{"matched":54,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0229a01","n":"0229a","t":"成唯識論述記卷第一本沙門"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0229b01","n":"0229b","t":"聯蹤多覿葱右之英罕聞天竺"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0229c01","n":"0229c","t":"則賓主云烈旗鼓載揚幽關洞"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0230a01","n":"0230a","t":"楞迦厚嚴十一部論瑜伽顯揚"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0230b01","n":"0230b","t":"華嚴等中說一切法皆唯有識"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0230c01","n":"0230c","t":"識如經中說三界唯心三攝假"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0231a01","n":"0231a","t":"界通無漏善故為教體於理無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0231b01","n":"0231b","t":"三第三有二第四有五故有十"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0231c01","n":"0231c","t":"諸部說異今依大乘九百年間"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0232a01","n":"0232a","t":"論釋之論師也七梵云質呾羅"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0232b01","n":"0232b","t":"故名稽首此唯身業敬相不盡"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0232c01","n":"0232c","t":"真如性故稱為滿澂鑒無垢二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0233a01","n":"0233a","t":"集論初序云此論所依及能起"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0233b01","n":"0233b","t":"乘此中所敬何者三寶答此中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0233c01","n":"0233c","t":"十四卷顯揚第六第十三卷及"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0234a01","n":"0234a","t":"薩埵此言有情有情識故今談"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0234b01","n":"0234b","t":"謂滅受想定麁動受滅故說為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0234c01","n":"0234c","t":"顯悟次顯斷後得果此即初也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0235a01","n":"0235a","t":"有情沒三界故此上四義毀責"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0235b01","n":"0235b","t":"答上二問所徵今此總四句答"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0235c01","n":"0235c","t":"生即是發業潤生煩惱今此論"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0236a01","n":"0236a","t":"雖作二種無我真如觀等大非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0236b01","n":"0236b","t":"論者即假者迷謬人也述曰此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0236c01","n":"0236c","t":"心境二法隨一攝故如心心所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0237a01","n":"0237a","t":"大小二乘執心執所非多非異"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0237b01","n":"0237b","t":"解如其境實正解生也上來長"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0237c01","n":"0237c","t":"一頌半略標離心無別我法以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0238a01","n":"0238a","t":"中故名為世間由此滅道或非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0238b01","n":"0238b","t":"非實有體說為我法此釋順下"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0238c01","n":"0238c","t":"解云以無依有世間說情以為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0239a01","n":"0239a","t":"及麁顯境唯前六故對此六塵"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0239b01","n":"0239b","t":"量了別境故四濫隣近不言及"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0239c01","n":"0239c","t":"也仍未了知我法二義述曰我"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0240a01","n":"0240a","t":"者准論釋者命謂第八現行者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0240b01","n":"0240b","t":"及諸師法至下當知述曰即諸"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0240c01","n":"0240c","t":"若彼我法性相非有假我法相"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0241a01","n":"0241a","t":"問前言識變變義如何述曰此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0241b01","n":"0241b","t":"此依他起如何說為我法二相"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0241c01","n":"0241c","t":"引令知假說非謂實有問前護"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0242a01","n":"0242a","t":"法與所計執有少作用相狀可"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0242b01","n":"0242b","t":"中咸言有義非多有義便謂多"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0242c01","n":"0242c","t":"名似我法彼妄所執我法實無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0243b01","n":"0243b","t":"識所變我法故護法難陀二義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0244a01","n":"0244a","t":"理也或世即俗是持業釋勝義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0244b01","n":"0244b","t":"法故識境所依亦勝義者是俗"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0244c01","n":"0244c","t":"自下第三別問別答於中有二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0245a01","n":"0245a","t":"又此為二一常二遍同空以下"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0245b01","n":"0245b","t":"不判之且者偏舉未盡之義非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0245c01","n":"0245c","t":"諸業許常故許遍故說喻如前"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0246a01","n":"0246a","t":"相離色許多種色更互相遍體"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0246b01","n":"0246b","t":"責如天授解脫餘亦應爾作業"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0246c01","n":"0246c","t":"皮此破第二有五比量述曰結"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0247a01","n":"0247a","t":"蘊亦非蘊外並離蘊計述曰筏"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0247b01","n":"0247b","t":"常故為此破破一比量亦准此"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T43n1830-成唯識論述記卷001a","source":"CBETA T43n1830 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":113,"unit":"T43 頁欄"}